    "message": "Recover true neighboring tile colors and exclude zero cyclic time shift\n\nDerive all four complemented labels of each supplied selected tile from original Facts. Aggregate the actual spatial/temporal bit copies and cancel bounded complements to prove East(current)=West(previous) and South(current)=North(temporal), with count, alignment and labels discharged internally.\n\nUse the forced actual Start to exclude a temporal displacement of zero modulo the entire cyclic word: Start South1 cannot equal its North435. This needs no all-cell occupation, positive-stride or shift-bound premise and excludes all full-period multiples. Record full author review, successful bounded main/check execution and five standard-only axiom audits; keep global assignment and machine semantics separate.",
